-#
-#  Sub-items of the "Finanzen" main-nav section (entered at /fin, the overview
-#  page): Konten & Wallets holds the money accounts, their statements and the
-#  camt transactions; Beiträge the person fees and the payment plans behind its
-#  own overview; Moss the
-#  Moss overview / transactions; Buchhaltung the DATEV bookkeeping / bookings;
-#  Abstimmung matches accounting entries with bookings; Controlling is still
-#  empty.
-#
-#  Every entry lists ONLY its own path fragments, so no two light up at once
-#  and none of them needs an inactive_for.
-#  See doc/navigation.md for how nav / sheets / tabs fit together.
%ul.nav-left-list
  -# The overview entry needs no fragments: current_page? matches /fin exactly.
  = nav t("fin.nav.overview"), fin_path
  = nav t("fin.nav.accounts"), wsjrdp_fin_accounts_path, %w[fin/acc fin/tx]
  = nav t("fin.nav.fees"), fees_path, %w[fin/fees fin/person_fees fin/payment_plans]
  = nav t("fin.nav.moss"), moss_path, %w[fin/moss]
  = nav t("fin.nav.accounting"), bookkeeping_path, %w[fin/bookkeeping]
  = nav t("fin.nav.reconciliation"), reconciliation_path, %w[fin/reconciliation]
  = nav t("fin.nav.controlling"), controlling_path, %w[fin/controlling]
